A. Verify Table Name

The SQL verification checks that the credit card transaction tables exist and confirms the number of records stored in each table. The expected 1,296,675 transactions should match the original dataset, indicating that the data was successfully imported and is ready for further analysis.

--#1. Check Table Names and Table Numbers:SQL Table and Row Count Verification – Interpretation

SELECT
    TABLE_SCHEMA,
    TABLE_NAME
FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLES
WHERE TABLE_TYPE = 'BASE TABLE'
ORDER BY TABLE_NAME;

SELECT
    s.name AS SchemaName,
    t.name AS TableName,
    SUM(p.rows) AS TotalRows
FROM sys.tables AS t
INNER JOIN sys.schemas AS s
    ON t.schema_id = s.schema_id
INNER JOIN sys.partitions AS p
    ON t.object_id = p.object_id
WHERE p.index_id IN (0, 1)
GROUP BY
    s.name,
    t.name
ORDER BY
    t.name;

